msgstr "TPROXY + Redirect（TCP REDIRECT + UDP TPROXY）"

msgid "Fail-Open on Error"
msgstr "故障回落直连 (Fail-Open)"

msgid "When disabled (default), service failure switches to Fail-Closed Lockdown blocking non-whitelist LAN forwarding while keeping router SSH/LuCI reachable."
msgstr "默认关闭：服务异常时切入 Fail-Closed 锁定阻断态，拦截非白名单 LAN 转发防 IP 泄漏，同时保持路由器 SSH 与 LuCI 可访问。"

