msgid "Outbound Anti-Loop Mark"
msgstr "出站防环路标记"

msgid "Must be a non-zero 32-bit hexadecimal mark (e.g. 0xff)."
msgstr "必须为非零 32 位十六进制标记（例如 0xff）。"

msgid "UDP TPROXY Routing Mark"
msgstr "UDP TPROXY 策略路由标记"

msgid "Must be a non-zero 32-bit hexadecimal mark (e.g. 0x1)."
